  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the CRM Scope**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on defining the scope of this CRM. Considering options, such as Apex Roofing CRM, Elite Roofing CRM, or Peak Roofing, and the screenshots that were provided, I\'m analyzing the full-stack requirements to make sure it\'s a comprehensive fit. I\'m focusing on key features based on provided details.\n\n\n**Assessing the Tech Stack**\n\nI\'m now assessing the available tech skills in light of the \"hazlo realidad\" prompt. Firebase integration seems relevant for a fully functional application, especially with the interactive CRM visuals provided. However, I\'m now also considering the possibility of a client-side React app using localStorage, given the visual emphasis. The image references strongly suggest the need for data storage and user interface functionality.\n\n\n**Evaluating App Size & Scope**\n\nI\'m now determining the app\'s overall size. A comprehensive roofing CRM with interactive components like the Estimator, client profiles, and AI Copilot seems to be in scope based on the provided screenshots and descriptions. The lack of explicit database or login requirements simplifies the approach, leaning towards a client-side solution. I\'ll inspect the HTML templates in the workspace and check the directory contents.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will now view the `package.json` file to understand the configuration and see what dependencies are available."
