  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining AI Copilot Panel**\n\nI\'m now focused on the AI Copilot side-drawer component. I\'ve decided to name it `src/components/AICopilotPanel.tsx`. It will function as a right sidebar in Estimates and Client timeline views and will be responsible for displaying AI suggestions.\n\n\n**Developing the Chat Functionality**\n\nI\'m now implementing the `/api/copilot` interaction within the chat. I\'m focusing on sending the message, history, and context, and incorporating the AI\'s responses. I\'m aiming for smooth micro-animations and loading indicators for a premium feel. The visual design is also on my mind, keeping the right-hand panel dimensions (320px), header (\"AI Copilot\" with icon, contextual intelligence subtitle in Emerald styling), and tab structure (\"Review\" and \"Chat\") as my guide. I am ready to implement and render the suggested features, as well.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will now create `/src/components/AICopilotPanel.tsx`. This component handles the right-side contextual intelligence sidebar. It features a \"Review\" tab (with risk scores, smart summaries, proactive warning flags, and quick suggestions) and a \"Chat\" tab connected to our Express backend `/api/copilot` to provide real Gemini-powered replies based on the user\'s current view."
