  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Dev Server Readiness**\n\nThe dev server restart was successful, which is great! Now, I am focused on confirming that the variables are correctly declared within the `.env.example` file. To ensure everything is in place, I\'ll use the `view_file` command on `.env.example` to check for `GEMINI_API_KEY`. Finally, I\'m returning to the user prompt description for review.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully completed and launched **Apex Roofing CRM**, a high-fidelity, full-stack management and estimation SaaS platform designed for professional roofing contractors. The application features a highly responsive and crafted slate-colored aesthetic, automated workflows, and an intelligent contextual AI Copilot powered by the latest **Gemini 3.5 Flash** model.\n\n### Key Highlights of Your New CRM:\n\n*   **Responsive Sidebar Navigation**: Easily transition between the main Dashboard, active Leads, the Claims Estimator, the Production pipeline, Financials, and Team profiles. Includes a prominent \"+ Nuevo Proyecto\" (New Project) shortcut button.\n*   **Dynamic Claims Estimator (`/claims`)**:\n    *   **Interactive Line Items Table**: View and edit material and labor quantities, units, and unit prices (e.g., *Owens Corning Shingles*, *RhinoRoof Underlayment*, *Cobra Ridge Venting*, and *Mano de Obra*).\n    *   **Real-Time Calculations**: Instantly updates subtotals, gross estimates, 8.25% taxes, final totals, and actual profit margins as values are adjusted.\n    *   **AI Auto-Adjuster**: When profit margins fall below the company minimum of 30%, the system flags it and exposes an **\"Auto-adjust to 30%\"** button, which dynamically calculates and sets the required labor unit price to secure maximum profitability.\n*   **Customer & Leads Folder (`/leads`)**:\n    *   **Interactive Chronological Timeline**: Post custom notes or peritaje updates in real-time, or inspect existing uploads (such as real high-resolution storm damage photos).\n    *   **Claim & Insurance Dossier**: Review State Farm insurer contacts, adjuster details, and property dimensions.\n    *   **Documents & Checklists**: Drag-and-drop or upload mock aerial reports (EagleView) and toggle pending site tasks.\n*   **Visual Production Kanban (`/production`)**:\n    *   Advance projects (such as the *Anderson* and *Martinez* residences) through production stages: *Scheduled*, *Material Ordered*, *In Progress*, and *QA Inspection*.\n    *   Includes a quality assurance inspection popup containing checklist items. Once checked, projects are cleared for handover and push invoices straight to financials.\n*   **Full Financial Overview (`/financials`) & Team Directory (`/team`)**:\n    *   Track YTD Revenue, outstanding AR, and net margins. Compare performance across commercial flat roofs, standing seam metal roofs, and residential asphalt shingles.\n    *   Filter active installation crews, senior sales reps, and PMs to view live close rates, sites inspected, and on-time statistics.\n*   **Contextual AI Copilot (`AICopilotPanel`)**:\n    *   **An\303\241lisis Tab**: Displays high-level summaries, active insurance risk assessments (with approval probability bars), warning indicators, and quick action buttons.\n    *   **Chat Tab**: Connected to a secure, server-side `/api/copilot` Express route. It communicates with Gemini to analyze your current view, suggest storm claim email templates, write formal letters to insurance adjusters, or provide technical roofing calculations."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 770756209
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
