    modified_response: "I have successfully removed the AI Copilot from the application. Here is a summary of the changes:\n\n* **Removed AI Copilot Panel**: Deleted the entire right-hand AI side panel from the viewport layout. This allows the active CRM workspace views (Dashboard, Leads, Estimator, etc.) to occupy the full screen width, giving you a wider, cleaner, and more productive workspace.\n* **Streamlined Header Controls**: Removed the AI toggle button (robot icon) from the mobile and desktop headers to clean up the navigation interface.\n* **Simplified State Management**: Removed all chat histories, suggestions, loading states, and side-effects from the main React components.\n* **Lean Backend Server**: Cleaned up `server.ts` by removing the Google GenAI library imports, client initialization, and the `/api/copilot` endpoint, making the server more lightweight.\n* **Database & Types Cleanup**: Cleared out references to `ChatMessage`, `AICopilotReview`, and related mock data fields within the database schemas and type definitions to prevent any bloat or typescript warnings."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
